        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Park Dietz, Richard Kuklinski\n- Roles: forensic psychiatrist\n- Organizations: American Mafia, DeCavalcante crime family, Five Families\n- Places: Newark, New Jersey, New York City\n- Events: Joel Rifkin case, Arthur Shawcross case, Jeffrey Dahmer case, Unabomber case, Beltway sniper attacks, Jared Lee Loughner case\n\nFacts:\n- Park Dietz was born in 1948 and is a forensic psychiatrist.\n- Park Dietz consulted or testified in high-profile United States criminal cases involving Joel Rifkin, Arthur Shawcross, Jeffrey Dahmer, the Unabomber, Richard Kuklinski, the Beltway sniper attacks, and Jared Lee Loughner.\n- Richard Kuklinski was associated with members of the American Mafia.\n- Richard Kuklinski was associated with the DeCavalcante crime family of Newark, New Jersey, and the Five Families of New York City.",
